<title>USA: South River, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>South River, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc. said it won $3.475 million of South River, N.J., general improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a lowest rate of 5.00, highest price of 100.015.</p>
</text>
